<p>Your golem pulls all foes within radius <acronym class="talent-variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00">3, 4, 4, 5, 5</acronym> toward itself while dealing <acronym class="variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00,<br>spellpower 100">71, 96, 115, 131, 145</acronym> arcane damage.</p>